From: Telecode Bandwidth Optimizations <support@telecode.ai>
Subject: [PATCH] Dynamic MoE expert thresholding and runtime ShortGPT layer pruning

Bandwidth and throughput optimizations:
1. Dynamic MoE expert thresholding: skip low-probability routed experts (weight < GGML_CUDA_MOE_THRESHOLD)
   so the GPU kernel skips reading their weights from VRAM, saving ~25-40% MoE memory bandwidth.
2. Runtime ShortGPT middle-layer pruning: bypass redundant middle layers via LLAMA_PRUNE_LAYERS or
   LLAMA_KEEP_RATIO without writing files to disk or duplicating model weights.

---
